{"strongs": "H4550", "word": "מַסַּע", "translit": "mas.sa", "root": "מסע", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "pulling up, breaking camp, setting out, journey", "definition": "מַסַּע noun [masculine] pulling up, breaking camp, setting out, journey ; — absolute ׳ מ Num 10:2 ; Deut 10:11 plural construct מַסְעֵי Num 10:28 ; Num 33:1 suffix מַסָּעָיו Gen 13:3 , מַסְעֵיהֶם Exod 17:1 + 6 t.; — 1. a. pulling up, breaking camp (with accusative מַחֲנֶה ; Ges «GKC:45e»§ 45e , «GKC:115d»115d) Num 10:2 . \\ \\ b. setting out Num 10:6 , compare v Num 10:23 . 2. station, stage, journey (by stages), ׳ וַיֵּלֶךְ לְמ Gen 13:3 and he went by (according to) his journeyings (compare הלך , p. 231 a above); לְמַסְעֵיהֶם Exod 17:1 compare Exod 40:36 ; Exod 40:38 ; Num 10:12 (all P ; all with נָסַע ), Num 33:1 ; Num 33:2 (|| מוֺצָאֵיהֶם ), v Num 33:2 (|| id. ); קוּם לֵךְ לְמַסַּע Deut 10:11 for journeying (see Dr ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5244')\">BDB5244</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4550')\">H4550</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5243')\">BDB5243</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5245')\">BDB5245</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַסַּע</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>pulling up, breaking camp, setting out, journey</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 10:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,2)\">Num 10:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 10:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,11)\">Deut 10:11</ref> plural construct <bdbheb>מַסְעֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 10:28\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,28)\">Num 10:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 33:1\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(4,33,1)\">Num 33:1</ref> suffix <bdbheb>מַסָּעָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 13:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,3)\">Gen 13:3</ref>, <bdbheb>מַסְעֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 17:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,1)\">Exod 17:1</ref> + 6 t.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlight>pulling up, breaking</highlight> camp (with accusative <bdbheb>מַחֲנֶה</bdbheb>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:45e»§ 45e</sup>, «GKC:115d»115d) <ref ref=\"Num 10:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,2)\">Num 10:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>setting out</highlight> <ref ref=\"Num 10:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,6)\">Num 10:6</ref>, compare v<ref ref=\"Num 10:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,23)\">Num 10:23</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>station, stage, journey</highlight> (by stages), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וַיֵּלֶךְ לְמ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 13:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,3)\">Gen 13:3</ref> <highlight>and he went by</highlight> (according to) <highlight>his journeyings</highlight> (compare <bdbheb>הלך</bdbheb>, p. 231 a above); <bdbheb>לְמַסְעֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 17:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,1)\">Exod 17:1</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Exod 40:36\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,36)\">Exod 40:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 40:38\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,38)\">Exod 40:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,12)\">Num 10:12</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; all with <bdbheb>נָסַע</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Num 33:1\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"33